    "content": "<!-- wp:cil/page-head {\"eyebrow\":\"Condition · Tight foreskin\",\"title\":\"Phimosis (tight foreskin)\",\"lede\":\"Phimosis means that the foreskin cannot be comfortably retracted over the head of the penis. In babies, a non-retractile foreskin can be a normal part of development and does not automatically mean they have phimosis.\",\"reviewedBy\":\"u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/team/#haidaru0022u003eDr Haidar Al-Ali, BDS, MFDS RCPS (Glasg)u003c/au003e, September 2026\",\"crumbs\":[{\"label\":\"Reasons\",\"href\":\"https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/phimosis/\"},{\"label\":\"Phimosis\",\"href\":\"\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section-sm\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap-narrow\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section-sm\"><div class=\"wrap-narrow\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"body-text\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-group body-text\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>In older children and adults, if there is pain/ discomfort or inability to retract the foreskin, the most predictable long term solution is a circumcision in our experience. The severity of phimosis varies, with some patients only experiencing some discomfort when retracting the foreskin whilst others are unable to retract the foreskin at all which leads to scarring, infections and in some severe cases the inability to pass urine.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>It can become a vicious cycle where a patient will try to retract the tight foreskin but cause micro tears in the skin. When it heals, this causes scarring which leads to more tightness and the condition worsens. Circumcision is a suitable long term option where the scar tissue and tight skin is removed which can relieve symptoms immediately.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/text-section {\"eyebrow\":\"Assessment\",\"heading\":\"Why the tight band matters\",\"html\":\"u003cdiv class=u0022body-textu0022u003eu003cpu003eIt is important for the practitioner to recognize a phimosis and not treating it in the same way as a normal circumcision. There is often a phimotic (tight) band that must be removed to relieve the symptoms. Otherwise, the tightness will still exist but just behind the head of the penis which will affect the comfort and cosmetic result.u003c/pu003ern          u003cpu003eSeek urgent medical help if the foreskin has been pulled back and becomes trapped behind the head of the penis with increasing swelling, or if the patient cannot pass urine. That is u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/conditions/paraphimosis/u0022u003eparaphimosisu003c/au003e.u003c/pu003ern          u003cpu003eAdult circumcision with a medical or foreskin problem is listed on the u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/prices/u0022u003eprices pageu003c/au003e. See also u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/adults/u0022u003eadult circumcisionu003c/au003e and u003ca href=u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/aftercare/u0022u003eaftercareu003c/au003e.u003c/pu003eu003c/divu003e\",\"narrow\":true,\"banded\":true} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/section {\"size\":\"section\",\"band\":\"\",\"wrap\":\"wrap\"} --><section class=\"wp-block-cil-section section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><!-- wp:cil/split {\"reverse\":false} --><div class=\"wp-block-cil-split split\"><!-- wp:cil/callout {\"title\":\"Request a consultation\",\"body\":\"\\u003cdiv data-reveal\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003cspan class=\\u0022caps eyebrow\\u0022\\u003eBeing seen\\u003c/span\\u003e\\r\\n        \\r\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022body-text\\u0022 style=\\u0022margin-top:20px\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n          \\u003cp\\u003eYou can request a consultation or book by contacting the clinic. If you are booking for a child, please read the identification and consent requirements before attending. Tell us about any medical conditions, medication, allergies or bleeding problems when you book.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003cdiv class=\\u0022btn-row\\u0022 style=\\u0022margin-top:26px\\u0022\\u003e\\r\\n          \\u003ca class=\\u0022btn\\u0022 href=\\u0022https://circumcision-london-wp.vercel.app/book/\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022book-condition\\u0022\\u003eBook a consultation\\u003c/a\\u003e\\r\\n          \\u003ca class=\\u0022btn btn-ghost\\u0022 href=\\u0022tel:+442089513794\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022call-condition\\u0022\\u003eCall 020 8951 3794\\u003c/a\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003c/div\\u003e\\r\\n        \\u003cdiv style=\\u0022margin-top:26px\\u0022\\u003e\\u003cdiv class=\\u0022callout urgent\\u0022 data-reveal\\u003e\\n\\t\\u003ch2 class=\\u0022display d-3\\u0022\\u003eIf this is urgent, do not wait for an appointment\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\t\\u003cp style=\\u0022margin-top:10px\\u0022\\u003eGo to A\\u0026amp;E today if a pulled-back foreskin is trapped behind the head of the penis and swelling, if you or your child cannot pass urine, or if there is spreading redness with a fever. Those need treating in hours. For anything else, call \\u003ca href=\\u0022tel:+442089513794\\u0022 data-track=\\u0022call-urgent\\u0022 style=\\u0022color:var(\\u002d\\u002dblue-deep);font-weight:600\\u0022\\u003e020 8951 3794\\u003c/a\\u003e and tell us what is happening, and we will bring you forward if you need it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"urgent\":true,\"level\":2} /--><!-- wp:cil/callback-card {\"eyebrow\":\"Request a call back\",\"title\":\"Describe it to us\",\"formId\":\"phimosis\",\"subject\":\"phimosis enquiry\",\"urgent\":false} /--></div><!-- /wp:cil/split --></div></section><!-- /wp:cil/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:cil/cta-band {\"title\":\"Book a consultation\",\"text\":\"You can request a consultation or book by contacting the clinic. Tell us about any medical conditions, medication, allergies or bleeding problems when you book.\"} /-->"
